---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout>
	<div class="site-shell">
		<header class="site-header">
			<a class="wordmark" href="#top" aria-label="Somatics and Embodiment home">
				<img class="brand-logo" src="/in-well-being-logo.png" alt="In well Being nautilus shell logo" />
				<span>Somatics <i>&</i> Embodiment<br /><small>with Claire Graziano</small></span>
			</a>
			<nav aria-label="Main navigation">
				<a href="#work">Ways to work together</a>
				<a href="#training">Training</a>
				<a href="#resources">Resources</a>
				<a class="nav-cta" href="#contact">Get in touch <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
			</nav>
		</header>

		<main id="top">
			<section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
				<div class="hero-copy">
					<p class="eyebrow"><span></span> A space to come back to yourself</p>
					<h1 id="hero-title">A deeper relationship with your body.<br /><em>A different way of living.</em></h1>
					<p class="hero-intro">Somatic support and education for reconnecting with your body, meeting your experience with care, and finding new possibilities for change.</p>
					<div class="hero-actions">
						<a class="button button-dark" href="#work">Explore the work <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
						<a class="text-link" href="#about">A little about Claire <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
					</div>
					<div class="hero-note"><span class="note-line"></span><span>Body-led. Relationship-centred.<br />Rooted in curiosity and compassion.</span></div>
				</div>
				<div class="hero-art" aria-label="Abstract illustration of a person held by soft, flowing shapes" role="img">
					<div class="art-sun"></div><div class="art-orbit orbit-one"></div><div class="art-orbit orbit-two"></div>
					<div class="art-body"><div class="art-head"></div><div class="art-shoulder"></div><div class="art-torso"></div></div>
					<div class="art-leaf leaf-one"></div><div class="art-leaf leaf-two"></div>
					<p class="art-caption">A softer way<br />to meet yourself</p>
					<span class="art-star star-one">✳</span><span class="art-star star-two">✳</span>
				</div>
				<div class="hero-bottom"><span>THERAPY · BODYWORK · LEARNING</span><a href="#work" aria-label="Scroll to ways to work together">↓</a><span>BASED IN THE UK · ONLINE & IN PERSON</span></div>
			</section>

			<section class="intro-band" id="about">
				<div class="about-photo-frame"><img class="about-photo" src="/claire-graziano.jpg" alt="Claire Graziano, somatic therapist and founder of In well Being" /><span class="photo-caption">Claire Graziano</span></div>
				<div class="about-copy"><p class="eyebrow">A little more room to be</p>
				<h2>What if your body isn’t something to fix,<br class="desktop-break" /> but a place to <em>begin?</em></h2>
				<p class="intro-text">I’m Claire. I offer thoughtful, body-centred spaces for people and practitioners to listen more deeply, work at a pace that feels possible, and discover what becomes available when the body is part of the conversation.</p>
				<a class="text-link" href="#contact">Meet Claire <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
			</section>

			<section class="work-section section-pad" id="work">
				<div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Ways to work together</p><h2>Support for where<br /><em>you are now.</em></h2></div><p class="section-aside">Different paths, held by a shared belief: change can happen when we feel safe enough to meet what’s here.</p></div>
				<div class="offer-grid">
					<article class="offer-card card-therapy"><div class="card-top"><span class="card-number">01</span><span class="card-icon" aria-hidden="true">◌</span></div><p class="card-label">INDIVIDUAL SUPPORT</p><h3>Therapy &<br />trauma recovery</h3><p>A gentle, collaborative space to understand how past experiences live in the present, and to build more choice, connection and steadiness over time.</p><a class="card-link" href="#contact">Explore therapy <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article>
					<article class="offer-card card-bodywork"><div class="card-top"><span class="card-number">02</span><span class="card-icon" aria-hidden="true">〰</span></div><p class="card-label">BODY-LED SESSIONS</p><h3>Somatic<br />body therapy</h3><p>Attentive, consent-led bodywork that makes space for sensation, movement and the body’s own pace—supporting a deeper sense of inhabiting yourself.</p><a class="card-link" href="#contact">Explore body therapy <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article>
					<article class="offer-card card-training" id="training"><div class="card-top"><span class="card-number">03</span><span class="card-icon" aria-hidden="true">✳</span></div><img class="training-image" src="/ecm-integration-therapy.png" alt="Extracellular Matrix Integration Therapy illustration" /><p class="card-label">FOR PRACTITIONERS</p><h3>ECM Integration<br />Therapies training</h3><p>Experiential learning for practitioners who want to bring more embodiment, curiosity and relational awareness into their work.</p><a class="card-link" href="#contact">Explore training <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article>
				</div>
			</section>

			<section class="quote-band"><span class="quote-mark" aria-hidden="true">“</span><blockquote>There is no right way to be in your body.<br /><em>There is only your way, discovered over time.</em></blockquote><p>CLAIRE GRAZIANO</p><span class="quote-sun" aria-hidden="true">✳</span></section>

			<section class="resources-section section-pad" id="resources">
				<div class="resources-copy"><p class="eyebrow">A place to begin, for free</p><h2>Ideas to carry<br /><em>into your day.</em></h2><p>Short teachings and reflections to help you get curious about your body and the small moments that shape how you feel.</p><a class="button button-dark" href="#contact">Browse free resources <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
				<div class="resource-stack"><article class="resource-card"><span class="resource-type">A GENTLE PRACTICE · 5 MIN</span><h3>Arriving in the body</h3><p>A simple invitation to notice what is supporting you, right now.</p><span class="resource-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></article><article class="resource-card resource-card-clay"><span class="resource-type">A REFLECTION · 4 MIN</span><h3>Listening without fixing</h3><p>What might shift when you meet a sensation with curiosity?</p><span class="resource-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></article><div class="course-note"><span aria-hidden="true">✳</span><p><strong>More learning is on its way.</strong><br />Online courses are in development. Join the conversation to hear when they’re ready.</p></div></div>
			</section>

			<section class="contact-section" id="contact"><div><p class="eyebrow">Take the next small step</p><h2>Let’s start<br /><em>with a conversation.</em></h2><p>You don’t need to have it all figured out. Reach out with a question, or simply say hello.</p><a class="button button-light" href="mailto:claire.graziano14@gmail.com">Email Claire <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><div class="contact-details"><a href="mailto:claire.graziano14@gmail.com"><span class="contact-label">Email</span><span class="contact-value">claire.graziano14@gmail.com</span></a><a href="tel:+447565544438"><span class="contact-label">Phone</span><span class="contact-value">+44 7565 544438</span></a><a href="https://maps.google.com/?q=77+Station+Road,+Impington,+Cambridgeshire,+CB24+7NP" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><span class="contact-label">Business & address</span><span class="contact-value"><strong>In well Being</strong><br />Founder of the Centre for Somatic &amp; Embodiment Therapies<br /><br />77 Station Road,<br />Impington,<br />Cambridgeshire,<br />CB24 7NP</span></a></div></div><div class="contact-mark" aria-hidden="true"><span>✳</span><i></i><b></b></div></section>
		</main>

		<footer class="site-footer"><a class="footer-brand" href="#top"><img class="footer-logo" src="/in-well-being-logo.png" alt="" /><span class="footer-brand-copy">Somatics <i>&</i> Embodiment <small>with Claire Graziano</small></span></a><p>Care for the whole of you.</p><div><a href="#work">Work together</a><a href="#resources">Resources</a><a href="mailto:claire.graziano14@gmail.com">Email Claire</a></div><small>© {new Date().getFullYear()} Claire Graziano</small></footer>
	</div>
</Layout>

<style>
	@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,500;0,600;1,500;1,600&display=swap');
	:global(*) { box-sizing: border-box; }
	:global(html) { scroll-behavior: smooth; background: #f7f5ef; }
	:global(body) { margin: 0; color: #303b34; font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; }
	:global(a) { color: inherit; }
	.site-shell { --font-serif: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif; --text-xs: 12px; --text-sm: 14px; --text-base: 16px; --text-lg: 20px; --heading-card: 26px; --heading-section: clamp(36px, 4.2vw, 56px); --heading-hero: clamp(42px, 5vw, 66px); --line-body: 1.75; font-size: var(--text-base); line-height: var(--line-body); }
	.site-shell { --ink: #20352a; --muted-ink: #4c5d52; --forest: #254b39; --forest-hover: #173c2c; --sage: #dce8dc; --sage-mid: #c6d7c5; --clay: #ad563e; --cream: #fffdf8; }
	.site-shell { overflow: hidden; }
	.site-header { height: 92px; padding: 0 7.2%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; background: #f7f5ef; }
	.wordmark { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; text-decoration: none; font-size: var(--text-lg); font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -.04em; }
	.brand-logo { display: block; width: 52px; height: 52px; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 50%; }
	.wordmark-mark { color: #a16c58; font-size: 27px; }
	.wordmark i, .footer-brand i { font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif; font-weight: 500; color: #9b7561; }
	.wordmark small { display: inline-block; padding-top: 5px; color: #778078; font-size: var(--text-sm); font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: .05em; }
	nav { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 34px; font-size: var(--text-sm); font-weight: 500; }
	nav a { text-decoration: none; transition: color .2s; } nav a:hover, .text-link:hover, .card-link:hover { color: #a16c58; }
	.nav-cta { border: 1px solid #c9cec4; border-radius: 100px; padding: 12px 17px; } .nav-cta span { padding-left: 9px; }
	.hero { min-height: 660px; padding: 62px 7.2% 0; background: #e9eee5; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.04fr .96fr; position: relative; }
	.hero-copy { align-self: center; max-width: 620px; padding-bottom: 45px; position: relative; z-index: 2; }
	.eyebrow { margin: 0 0 21px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .14em; font-size: var(--text-xs); font-weight: 700; color: #697970; } .eyebrow span { display: inline-block; width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 100%; background: #b87961; margin-right: 8px; vertical-align: 1px; }
	h1, h2, h3, blockquote { font-family: var(--font-serif); font-weight: 500; }
	h1 { max-width: 570px; margin: 0; font-size: var(--heading-hero); line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -.045em; } h1 em, h2 em, blockquote em { color: #9b7561; font-weight: 500; }
	.hero-intro { max-width: 380px; margin: 25px 0 27px; color: #68736b; font-size: var(--text-base); line-height: var(--line-body); }
	.hero-actions { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 25px; } .button { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 24px; border-radius: 100px; text-decoration: none; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .08em; font-size: var(--text-xs); font-weight: 700; padding: 16px 20px; transition: transform .2s, background .2s; } .button:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); } .button-dark { color: #f7f5ef; background: #3d5145; } .button-dark:hover { background: #293c31; } .text-link { text-decoration: none; font-size: var(--text-sm); font-weight: 600; } .text-link span { padding-left: 8px; }
	.hero-note { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-top: 62px; color: #68736b; font-size: var(--text-xs); line-height: 1.6; } .note-line { height: 1px; width: 37px; background: #a1aa9f; }
	.hero-art { min-height: 520px; align-self: stretch; position: relative; overflow: hidden; } .art-sun { position: absolute; width: 300px; height: 300px; border-radius: 50%; background: #ddc7af; opacity: .82; top: 37px; left: 25%; } .art-orbit { position: absolute; border: 1px solid rgba(73,91,78,.22); border-radius: 50%; transform: rotate(-25deg); } .orbit-one { width: 430px; height: 310px; left: 8%; top: 100px; } .orbit-two { width: 380px; height: 450px; left: 17%; top: 10px; transform: rotate(32deg); }
	.art-body { position: absolute; width: 280px; height: 385px; left: 30%; bottom: 0; } .art-head { position: absolute; background: #b87961; width: 117px; height: 150px; border-radius: 52% 48% 49% 51%; top: 30px; left: 86px; transform: rotate(9deg); } .art-shoulder { position: absolute; background: #bd896e; width: 175px; height: 155px; border-radius: 60% 40% 10% 10%; top: 150px; left: 50px; transform: rotate(-7deg); } .art-torso { position: absolute; background: #7e917c; width: 242px; height: 245px; border-radius: 48% 52% 20% 25%; top: 232px; left: 10px; transform: rotate(3deg); }
	.art-leaf { position: absolute; z-index: 1; width: 80px; height: 30px; border: 1px solid #788c77; border-radius: 100% 0 100% 0; } .leaf-one { left: 12%; top: 48%; transform: rotate(27deg); } .leaf-two { right: 7%; top: 35%; transform: rotate(205deg); } .art-caption { position: absolute; z-index: 2; right: 2%; bottom: 54px; color: #445248; font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: italic; line-height: 1.35; } .art-star { position: absolute; color: #9b7561; } .star-one { top: 14%; right: 14%; font-size: 19px; } .star-two { top: 47%; left: 9%; font-size: 12px; }
	.hero-bottom { position: absolute; height: 52px; bottom: 0; left: 7.2%; right: 7.2%; border-top: 1px solid rgba(74,92,78,.18); display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; color: #738076; font-size: var(--text-xs); letter-spacing: .12em; } .hero-bottom a { text-decoration: none; font-size: 17px; }
	.intro-band { padding: 110px 20px 115px; text-align: center; background: #f7f5ef; } .intro-band .eyebrow { margin-bottom: 20px; } h2 { margin: 0; font-size: var(--heading-section); line-height: 1.12; letter-spacing: -.035em; } .intro-text { max-width: 550px; margin: 25px auto 22px; color: #747a73; font-size: var(--text-base); line-height: var(--line-body); }
	.intro-band { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(220px, .7fr) minmax(0, 1.3fr); align-items: center; gap: clamp(40px, 8vw, 110px); max-width: 1080px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 100px 7%; text-align: left; }
	.about-photo-frame { position: relative; justify-self: center; width: min(100%, 310px); padding: 12px 12px 42px; background: #e5ebdf; transform: rotate(-2deg); animation: photo-glide 8s ease-in-out infinite alternate; }
	.about-photo { display: block; width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 4 / 5; object-fit: cover; object-position: center 35%; }
	.photo-caption { position: absolute; bottom: 12px; left: 0; right: 0; color: var(--muted-ink); text-align: center; font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 16px; font-style: italic; }
	.about-copy h2 { max-width: 620px; }
	.about-copy .intro-text { max-width: 460px; margin: 25px 0 22px; }
	@keyframes photo-glide { from { transform: translateY(3px) rotate(-2deg); } to { transform: translateY(-7px) rotate(0deg); } }
	.section-pad { padding: 90px 10% 105px; } .work-section { background: #e6eae1; } .section-heading { display: flex; align-items: end; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 45px; } .section-heading .eyebrow { margin-bottom: 17px; } .section-aside { max-width: 290px; margin: 0 0 7px; color: #737c73; font-size: var(--text-sm); line-height: var(--line-body); }
	.offer-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 17px; } .offer-card { min-height: 330px; padding: 24px 25px 26px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; } .card-therapy { background: #f7f5ef; } .card-bodywork { background: #d6dfd2; } .card-training { background: #e8d5c7; } .card-top { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; } .card-number { color: #899087; font-size: var(--text-xs); letter-spacing: .12em; } .card-icon { color: #a16c58; font-size: 27px; } .card-label { margin: 31px 0 9px; font-size: var(--text-xs); letter-spacing: .13em; color: #748075; font-weight: 700; } .offer-card h3 { margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: var(--heading-card); line-height: 1.12; letter-spacing: -.02em; } .offer-card > p:not(.card-label) { max-width: 34ch; margin: 0; color: #747b73; font-size: var(--text-sm); line-height: var(--line-body); } .card-link { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-top: auto; padding-top: 22px; text-decoration: none; font-size: var(--text-xs); font-weight: 700; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(67,81,70,.23); padding-bottom: 9px; }
	.training-image { display: block; width: min(100%, 190px); aspect-ratio: 1; object-fit: contain; align-self: center; margin: 12px auto 0; animation: image-glide 7s ease-in-out infinite; }
	/* Gentle image movement adds a little life without distracting from the reading. */
	.art-sun { animation: shape-glide 9s ease-in-out infinite alternate; }
	.orbit-one { animation: orbit-glide 12s ease-in-out infinite alternate; }
	.art-body { animation: figure-glide 8s ease-in-out infinite alternate; }
	.art-caption { animation: caption-glide 8s ease-in-out infinite alternate; }
	@keyframes image-glide { 0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0); } 50% { transform: translateY(-7px); } }
	@keyframes shape-glide { from { transform: translateY(0); } to { transform: translateY(-9px); } }
	@keyframes orbit-glide { from { transform: rotate(-25deg) translateY(0); } to { transform: rotate(-22deg) translateY(-7px); } }
	@keyframes figure-glide { from { transform: translateY(3px); } to { transform: translateY(-6px); } }
	@keyframes caption-glide { from { transform: translateY(2px); } to { transform: translateY(-4px); } }
	.quote-band { background: #465b4c; color: #f7f5ef; text-align: center; padding: 83px 20px 69px; position: relative; } .quote-mark { display: block; font-family: Georgia,serif; color: #c29a7e; font-size: 54px; line-height: .8; } blockquote { margin: 12px 0 25px; font-size: clamp(25px,3vw,37px); line-height: 1.35; } blockquote em { color: #dec4af; } .quote-band > p { margin: 0; font-size: var(--text-xs); letter-spacing: .16em; color: #c4cfc3; } .quote-sun { position: absolute; top: 50%; right: 12%; color: #82917f; font-size: 37px; }
	.resources-section { display: grid; grid-template-columns: .9fr 1.1fr; gap: 9%; align-items: center; background: #f7f5ef; } .resources-copy .eyebrow { margin-bottom: 18px; } .resources-copy h2 { margin-bottom: 18px; } .resources-copy > p:not(.eyebrow) { max-width: 355px; color: #747a73; font-size: var(--text-base); line-height: var(--line-body); margin-bottom: 23px; } .resource-stack { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; } .resource-card { background: #e7ece4; padding: 20px 23px; position: relative; } .resource-card-clay { background: #eee0d5; } .resource-type { font-size: var(--text-xs); letter-spacing: .13em; color: #798479; font-weight: 700; } .resource-card h3 { margin: 10px 0 4px; font-size: 21px; } .resource-card p { margin: 0; max-width: 330px; color: #747a73; font-size: var(--text-sm); line-height: var(--line-body); } .resource-arrow { position: absolute; right: 22px; top: 20px; color: #9b7561; } .course-note { display: flex; gap: 13px; align-items: center; padding: 10px 3px; color: #6e786e; } .course-note > span { font-size: 20px; color: #a16c58; } .course-note p { margin: 0; font-size: var(--text-sm); line-height: var(--line-body); } .course-note strong { color: #3d5145; font-size: var(--text-sm); }
	.contact-section { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; padding: 80px 14%; background: #d4dfd1; } .contact-section .eyebrow { margin-bottom: 17px; } .contact-section h2 { font-size: var(--heading-section); } .contact-section > div:first-child > p:not(.eyebrow) { max-width: 335px; color: #70796f; font-size: var(--text-base); line-height: var(--line-body); margin: 18px 0 23px; } .button-light { background: #f7f5ef; color: #3d5145; } .contact-mark { position: relative; width: 200px; height: 200px; border: 1px solid rgba(63,82,68,.25); border-radius: 50%; display: grid; place-items: center; color: #a16c58; font-size: 51px; } .contact-mark:before, .contact-mark:after { content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 17px; border: 1px solid rgba(63,82,68,.2); border-radius: 50%; } .contact-mark:after { inset: -13px; border-color: rgba(63,82,68,.13); } .contact-mark i, .contact-mark b { position: absolute; width: 13px; height: 13px; border-radius: 50%; background: #9b7561; top: 12px; right: 33px; } .contact-mark b { width: 7px; height: 7px; top: auto; bottom: 14px; left: 38px; background: #788c77; }
	.contact-section { padding-left: max(14%, calc((100% - 1120px) / 2)); padding-right: max(14%, calc((100% - 1120px) / 2)); }
	.contact-details { display: grid; gap: 8px; margin-top: 22px; }
	.contact-details a { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px 14px; width: fit-content; color: var(--ink); text-decoration: none; font-size: var(--text-sm); }
	.contact-details a:hover { color: var(--clay); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; }
	.contact-details .contact-label { min-width: 48px; color: var(--muted-ink); font-weight: 700; }
	.contact-details .contact-value { line-height: 1.65; }
	.site-footer { padding: 35px 7.2%; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1fr auto; align-items: center; gap: 22px; background: #f7f5ef; } .footer-brand { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; text-decoration: none; font-size: var(--text-sm); font-weight: 700; } .footer-logo { display: block; width: 42px; height: 42px; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 50%; } .footer-brand-copy { display: block; color: var(--ink); } .footer-brand-copy small { display: block; margin-top: 4px; color: var(--muted-ink); font-size: var(--text-xs); font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: .05em; } .site-footer > p { font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: var(--text-sm); font-style: italic; color: #81877e; } .site-footer > div { display: flex; gap: 16px; } .site-footer > div a { text-decoration: none; font-size: var(--text-xs); color: #6f776e; } .site-footer small { color: #899087; font-size: var(--text-xs); }
	@media (max-width: 850px) { .site-header { padding: 0 5%; } nav { gap: 17px; } .hero { padding-left: 6%; padding-right: 6%; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; } .hero-art { transform: scale(.87); transform-origin: center; } .section-pad { padding-left: 6%; padding-right: 6%; } .offer-card { padding: 20px; } .site-footer { padding-left: 5%; padding-right: 5%; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto; } .site-footer > p { display: none; } }
